+## Use
+
+```python
+import gen_2205_04710 as gen
+
+inst = gen.make_instance(**gen.DIFFICULTY[gen.SHIPPING_DIFFICULTY], seed=123)
+question = gen.render(inst)
+candidate = gen.parse_answer(model_reply)
+ok, reason = gen.verify(inst, candidate)
